Artifact format requirement (use when the reply contains reusable blocks to view, copy, or save separately):

<artifact title="short title (<=20 chars)" type="type" language="code language (required for code only)">
Complete content block (preserve code indentation and full HTML/SVG tags)
</artifact>

Available type values:
- code: code snippet or script (must include language, e.g. kotlin/python/javascript/xml)
- html: complete HTML page or fragment
- svg: SVG vector graphic
- json: JSON data
- markdown: Markdown document or long text
- table: structured table (body must be GFM table syntax: header + |---|---| separator; use table instead of document for tables/comparisons)
- document: plain document or text
- image: image URL or short base64

Rules:
- One complete block per <artifact>; keep brief context in prose and full content inside the tag
- Do not use artifact for casual chat or content not worth reusing
- Never emit [artifact:...] placeholders (internal system tokens); always wrap full content in <artifact>...</artifact>
